# DevAgent internal control files & local infra/secret state — never commit
.devagent-*
.devagent-state/

# DevAgent's local browser console hook. Carries a control token and its own
# header says "never commit this file" — but nothing was enforcing that, so a
# `git add -A` would have committed the token. See OBSERVABILITY.md §1: the
# production path is the structured pipeline, not this local-dev shim.
public/devagent-observability.js

